Needs its SQLite file: `datasource/toolshed.yaml` opens `data/toolshed.db`, which
is machine-local and gitignored, so on a fresh checkout the app logs a connect
ERROR and the shared "clean startup" check fails.

Create the database, then run it explicitly:
  mkdir -p apps/toolshed/data
  sqlite3 apps/toolshed/data/toolshed.db < apps/toolshed/tests/schema.sql
  sqlite3 apps/toolshed/data/toolshed.db < apps/toolshed/tests/seed.sql
  cargo run -p test-framework -- apps/toolshed
